ose to what game situations call for. Their biggest outliers in how they line up are the lowest pre-snap motion rate in the league. Dak Prescott has run the passing game and leaned heavily on CeeDee Lamb, who has drawn 33% of the targets.","defense":"The Cowboys have one of the worst defenses in the league this season, ranking 27th or worse in four of the five main efficiency measures. Quinnen Williams has led the way with 5 sacks. In terms of scheme, they have the 3rd lowest blitz rate in the league.","special":"The Cowboys have been one of the most aggressive teams on fourth down, going for it on 50% of their short-yardage chances so far. Their kickers have made 77% of field goals, which is well below average. On the roster side, they put an unusually large share of their salary cap into receivers, about 19% of the money on the books. Their linebackers were among the youngest in the league.","players":"Dak Prescott has played nearly every snap at quarterback and thrown for 2,381 yards. CeeDee Lamb has been the clear top target with 33% of the looks and 904 receiving yards. Javonte Williams has handled most of the work in the backfield with 74% of the carries. On defense, Quinnen Williams leads the team with 5 sacks.","coaching":"Brian Schottenheimer is calling the offense as head coach and Christian Parker is calling the defense. Their offense looks most like the 2022 Colts under Frank Reich and the 2022 Seahawks. Their defense looks most like the 2023 Saints under Dennis Allen and the 2025 Seahawks under Mike Macdonald.","trends":"The offense went from 5th in EPA per play in 2025 to 7th so far this season, about where it was. The defense moved from 32nd in EPA allowed per play in 2025 to 30th so far this season, about where it was. The biggest change in approach was pre-snap motion rate, which went from 59% to 47%.","notes":"The 2026 pages are built from data that nflverse updates every week, so they will keep changing until the season ends. Personnel, formations, coverage and pressure numbers are missing for now because that data is only released after the season."}}